  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 602.09 Discharge",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 602.09 “Discharge” means the release or addition of any regulated contaminant to land, groundwater, or surface water.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 600) #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
